    "detailed_description": "A mysterious planetoid has appeared in the solar system, in a race to try and exploit its resources different nations send their robot-manned ships to investigate, however as the ships approach a powerful energy wave causes them to crash land almost destroying them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is now a race between the different factions marooned on the surface to reassemble their ships and head back to claim official ownership to the planetoid.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJetpacToo is a single or multi player game supporting cross play between flat-screen and VR. This has been created primarily to test the network and real-time planet terraforming technology for the upcoming god-game Me Igigu and what better way then to recreate an old-school classic in 3D.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has 2 main modes, All VS All where up to 6 people can compete to find (or steal) the resources to build their ships and protect their launch pad and Team Match, with 2 teams of up to 3 people each.",
    "about_the_game": "A mysterious planetoid has appeared in the solar system, in a race to try and exploit its resources different nations send their robot-manned ships to investigate, however as the ships approach a powerful energy wave causes them to crash land almost destroying them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is now a race between the different factions marooned on the surface to reassemble their ships and head back to claim official ownership to the planetoid.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJetpacToo is a single or multi player game supporting cross play between flat-screen and VR. This has been created primarily to test the network and real-time planet terraforming technology for the upcoming god-game Me Igigu and what better way then to recreate an old-school classic in 3D.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has 2 main modes, All VS All where up to 6 people can compete to find (or steal) the resources to build their ships and protect their launch pad and Team Match, with 2 teams of up to 3 people each.",
    "short_description": "A totally free reimagining of the classic Jetpac in a sandbox world with All Vs All or Team Match with unique real-time terraforming played over the surface of a planetoid created exclusively to test key components for the upcoming Me Igigu.",
